      "text": "The in-process top differs from the fallback top on five of the ten corpus prompts: plain readme, plain doctor setup, create-agent, save and repo-rule. On the typed readme prompt the two agree on the command but not on the top skill. The other five agree. [SOURCE: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/inprocess-timing-4/scratch/shape-live.jsonl]",
