      "id": "finding-2-1-the-literal-rank-6-wiring-loses-the-typed-command-on-the-typed-readme-prompt-the",
      "text": "The literal rank 6 wiring loses the typed command on the typed readme prompt. The handler names `sk-doc` with `/create:readme`, the existing filter emits a bare `sk-doc` skill row because `commandRowFor('sk-doc')` is empty, and today's fallback keeps `/create:readme`. Feeding handler rows to `degradedRecommendations` with `skillId` as the skill is a regression on the one guarantee Q026 makes. [SOURCE: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/inprocess-timing-4/scratch/shape-live.jsonl]",
