      "text": "The mode label needs a second small change. The hook's payload mapper already reads `needsMode` from a CLI recommendation, but the Q026 filter's rows carry no such field, so the in-process call alone cannot surface the label. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/lib/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts:389]",
